---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import macaPortrait from '../assets/maca-portrait.jpg';
---

<Base narrowContent={true} centerContent={true}>
  <div class="about">
    <Image
      src={macaPortrait}
      alt="Black-and-white close-up portrait of Maca, dark wavy hair falling across her face, wearing dark lipstick and a beaded drop earring, looking toward the camera."
      layout="fixed"
      width={125}
    />
    <p>
      Maca is a jack of all trades that loves to follow Metallica around the world catching
      meaningful moments in every concert or city. She yearns to showcase her photos and
      illustrations while keeping her IT job that allows her to accomplish her dreams. Her
      inspiration comes from film black and white photography, works of Virgil Finlay, Richey
      Beckett, Peeter Baltens, the 2013 Tumblr aesthetic and nature. Maca lives in Chile, in the
      boring city of Chillán with her two fat cats that prevent her from travelling for more than
      two weeks cause they get sad.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site has the double purpose of showcasing art while testing new development
      technologies. You can find the source code at{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/thisismaca/thisismaca.github.io"
        >https://github.com/thisismaca/thisismaca.github.io</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flow-root;
    padding: clamp(15px, 3vw, 30px);
  }

  /* S7.2/S7.3 — top-left, text wraps around it, at 768px and up. */
  .about :global(img) {
    margin-top: 5px;
    margin-left: 5px;
    margin-right: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    float: left;
  }

  /* S7.4 — below 768px, centred, all text beneath it instead. */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about :global(img) {
      float: none;
      display: block;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }
</style>
